OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThursday promises to be a fine
OL,6,Fday across the region. There will be
OL,7,Fsome cloud floating around at times,
OL,8,Fbut it will stay dry and some warm
OL,9,Fspells of sunshine are likely to
OL,10,Fdevelop. Feeling quite humid too.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will be dry and bright to
OL,13,Fend the day. However, cloud will
OL,14,Fgradually increase and thicken from
OL,15,Fthe northwest overnight with rain
OL,16,Fbeginning to edge in from the north.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
