OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FOutbreaks of rain will feed
OL,6,Fsoutheastwards across the region on
OL,7,FFriday morning, some perhaps heavy.
OL,8,FSkies brightening from the northwest
OL,9,Finto the afternoon. Still warm, though
OL,10,Ffeeling fresher than recently.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAnother
OL,13,Ffine day is expected on Saturday with
OL,14,Fsome sunshine. Very warm sunshine on
OL,15,FSunday, but turning windy. Rain
OL,16,Fovernight, clearing Monday morning to
OL,17,Fleave a day of sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
